-- The Part D ballots on the chain (S9, Q-S9-6 .. Q-S9-9 (a)). A kit file:
-- word literals and word ops are kit items. Each constant comes from the
-- host (`build/ballottool words`: the election key PK of thresholdtool (n 3,
-- t 2), the ring zkKey 0 .. 2 as points, poll 0, voters 0, 1 and 2 vote yes,
-- yes and no; k 2, yes is slot 0), and test/precompile.sh deploys this
-- contract after onehot.lang. ballotCtx is the hash chain from ballotTag
-- ("ballot") over the key image I and the poll (O34), and slotBound and
-- sumBound check the proofs of onehot.lang under it, so a ballot copied
-- under a second key image fails them. ballotSig checks the ring signature
-- over ballotDigest, the hash chain from digestTag ("digest") over the 8
-- slot ciphertext words, so a changed slot fails it. PK is a contract
-- constant (O39). tallyX and tallyY add two slot ciphertext points; the
-- opening views are those of threshold.lang on the summed slots. The cast
-- entry, the encrypted tally in state and enact are S10 (O40).
state State := makeState (cast : Nat)

def init : State := makeState 0

